{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13207140","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13207140","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1320714001:1":{"text":"老板娘，我在物色礼物，我的矮人朋友向我推荐了——","source_cn":"老板娘，我在物色礼物，我的矮人朋友向我推荐了——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56A135625DF67F4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320714002:0":{"text":"哦，矮人呐，他们肯定推荐了鱼罐头。","source_cn":"哦，矮人呐，他们肯定推荐了鱼罐头。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55036725950954E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320714003:1":{"text":"对对，好像是香脂腓做的罐头。","source_cn":"对对，好像是香脂腓做的罐头。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE90715B05D4C7B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320714004:1":{"text":"嗯，他们刚来镇上的那天看见我在吃，立马就被那种味道吸引住了，从此上了瘾。","source_cn":"嗯，他们刚来镇上的那天看见我在吃，立马就被那种味道吸引...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4DFF370261B8E65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320714005:1":{"text":"请给我两罐！<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，这么好的东西，我们俩先替莱卡他们尝一尝。","source_cn":"请给我两罐！<style=stress><player...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0D102B6905B22C74","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"请给我两罐！<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，这么好的东西，我们俩先替莱卡他们尝一尝。","female":"请给我两罐！<style=\"st