ndex":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320714011:1":{"text":"不瞒你说，我还偷偷存了两罐呢，准备留着自己吃。","source_cn":"不瞒你说，我还偷偷存了两罐呢，准备留着自己吃。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35B5EC95389DEDC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320714012:1":{"text":"老板娘，我就知道您是好人！","source_cn":"老板娘，我就知道您是好人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5E045A1B8ED8C89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320714013:1":{"text":"丑话说在前面。这鱼罐头不能随便卖给你们。你们得用<style=\"highlight\">魇鳗</style>和我交换。","source_cn":"丑话说在前面。这鱼罐头不能随便卖给你们。你们得用<st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x143AF5FCE4C64080","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320714014:1":{"text":"我正在开发新菜单，需要用到魇鳗，但我又不敢去阴森森的地方……你们像是经验丰富的冒险者，肯定不害怕。","source_cn":"我正在开发新菜单，需要用到魇鳗，但我又不敢去阴森森的地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x812E86273D911398","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320714015:1":{"text":"或许我勉强算是经验丰富的冒险者……但我可不擅长钓鱼啊。","source_cn":"或许我勉强算是经验丰富的冒险者……但我可不擅长钓鱼啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE249D9BFBFD657AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","